---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Theysway Privacy Policy"
  description="How Theysway, operated by Anomalies.in, handles data from Instagram accounts that creators connect."
>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div class="text-electric-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Theysway</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500">Last updated: 2 October 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Who we are</h2>
          <p>Theysway is an influencer-marketing service operated by Anomalies.in. This policy covers the Theysway app that creators use to connect their Instagram professional account.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">What we read</h2>
          <p>When you connect your Instagram professional account and approve access, Theysway reads your profile and Insights: reach, views, saves, shares, watch time, audience demographics, and comments on your own posts. We read only what you approve on Instagram's consent screen.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How we use it</h2>
          <p>We use this data only to assess fit for brand collaborations you may be considered for. We never post, message, follow, like, or change anything on your account.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell, license, or share your raw data. Brands receive our analysis only.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Storage and retention</h2>
          <p>Access tokens are kept in access-restricted storage and expire after 60 days unless you renew access. We keep your data only while it is needed for the purpose above, or until you ask us to delete it.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="data-deletion">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Revoking access and deleting your data</h2>
          <p>To revoke access at any time, open Instagram → Settings → Website permissions → Apps and websites, and remove Theysway.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">To delete your data, email <a class="text-electric-400 underline" href="mailto:yogesh@anomalies.in">yogesh@anomalies.in</a> from the address linked to your account, or name your Instagram handle. We delete all data we hold about you within 7 days and confirm by email.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy: <a class="text-electric-400 underline" href="mailto:yogesh@anomalies.in">yogesh@anomalies.in</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
